{"c":[{"name":"20260923T232506Z-24460cae37479591","text":"choose-verification-model place_effort takes tier from score-neighbors, but hand-set tiers are not monotone in score (kimi-k3-high A 77.87 > opus S 77.07): kimi-k3-low/medium place as S above their A sibling. Interpolated score is order-identical to just-beside-sibling.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T232738Z-a3126083d6a8469e","text":"choose-verification-model ranks the BenchLM model, not the effort. Catalog keys are stems and effort_encoded is false. The printed reviewer keeps the effort on the first --reviewer-models spelling of that model.","type":"note"}]}
